Our AI security controls include output PII redaction, confidence threshold escalation, and model update security review. We enforce human oversight contractually to ensure that automated decisions are validated by humans. Our design principle is "inference API only - no direct model access for end users", which ensures that decisions are not made without explicit validation of an agent.

